  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de reformas para el fortalecimiento de la logstica y la integracin comercial de Paraguay</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reform program to strengthen logistics and trade integration in Paraguay</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general es contribuir a la mejora del desempeo logstico y la integracin comercial de Paraguay a travs del fortalecimiento de la gobernanza y la sostenibilidad del sector logstico y la facilitacin del comercio exterior. Los objetivos especficos son: (i) fortalecer las instituciones vinculadas a la gestin logstica y de facilitacin comercial; (ii) impulsar la inversin sostenible en infraestructura y servicios de logstica; y (iii) facilitar y ampliar el acceso de las empresas de Paraguay a los mercados internacionales y promover la IED.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective is to contribute to the improvement of logistical performance and the commercial integration of Paraguay through the strengthening of governance and the sustainability of the logistics sector and the facilitation of foreign trade. The specific objectives are: (i) to strengthen institutions linked to logistical management and commercial facilitation;(ii) boost sustainable investment in infrastructure and logistics services; y(iii) facilitate and expand the access of Paraguayan companies to international markets and promote FDI.</narrative>
  </description>
